==English==

===Verb===
'''zombify'''

# {{transitive}} To turn into a [[zombie]] - the [[living dead]] or [[undead]].
#: ''She managed to flee the sorcerer who had attempted to '''zombify''' her and enjoyed relative prosperity in Jamaica.'' &mdash; Arnold ''et al'', ''A History of Literature in the Caribbean: Hispanic and Francophone Regions'' (1994)
# {{transitive|computing|of a personal computer}} To use as a [[zombie]] in order to disseminate [[spam]].
#: ''These [[trojan]]s can '''zombify''' your machine.''

